---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an id" viewBox="0 0 480 218" role="img" aria-label="A retried request returns the stored answer instead of charging twice"><rect class="nd " x="16" y="60" width="100" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="69" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="77.0" y="85" text-anchor="middle">Client</text><rect class="nd " x="190" y="40" width="110" height="110" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="200" y="49" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="256.0" y="65" text-anchor="middle">IDEM</text><rect class="nd " x="350" y="60" width="114" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="360" y="69" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="418.0" y="85" text-anchor="middle">Payment</text><path class="ln" d="M116 95 L190 95"/><path class="ln" d="M300 95 L350 95"/><text class="sm m" x="245" y="92" text-anchor="middle">pay-7</text><g class="id-w0"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="95" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/><circle class="pk" cx="300" cy="95" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:50px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0.5s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/></g><g class="id-w1"><text class="sm" x="150" y="150" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">✕ reply lost</text></g><g class="id-w2"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="95" r="5" fill="var(--c2)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/><circle class="pk" cx="190" cy="115" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:-74px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0.6s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/></g><g class="id-w3"><text class="sm" x="245" y="128" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">stored</text></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="176" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="id-w0"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle">First call: executed once, the answer is stored.</text></g><g class="id-w1"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">The reply is lost. The client retries.</text></g><g class="id-w2"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle">Retry: the stored answer comes back. Payment is not hit again.</text></g><g class="id-w4 an-fin"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">One charge, however many retries.</text></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Retries that run once</b>IDEM stores the answer to a request key, so a replay returns it instead of running again.</figcaption>
</figure>
